---
title: Shell & components
summary: The chrome around a page. Frame is the headless composition you build from; Shell is the batteries-included default — header, sidebar, search, mobile bar. Plus Doc, Sidebar, Pager, and an opt-in theme.
related:
  - ogygia/ogygia
